      "solution": "const n = parseInt(readline());\nconst keys = readline().split(' ');\nconst about = readline();\nlet output = '';\nfor (let char of about) {\n  if (char.match(/[0-9]/))\n    output += char;\n  else if (char.match(/[A-Z]/))\n    output += String.fromCharCode(char.charCodeAt() - keys.shift());\n}\nconsole.log(output.toLowerCase());",
